Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["ResolveAndCanonicalizeSeed", "ObjectName",
 CellID->456117676,ExpressionUUID->"736359cd-de6a-7046-9605-d4644f433629"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"9933f914-9d7d-9c4b-914f-0dc04058be81"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["ResolveAndCanonicalizeSeed",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
ResolveAndCanonicalizeSeed"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "config", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1e6d8a82-116e-8a4b-ad6e-2d46314c6b1b"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "resolves the seed rule and initial state of the normalized configuration ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["config", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cf958442-409a-6444-bf2d-807200ac1ac1"],
 " into canonical forms and gives a seed association, or a Failure."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->757204602,ExpressionUUID->"a5c6ae4a-00db-724f-a441-1856629eb066"],

Cell["\<\
Explicit seeds are canonicalized in the configured universe. An Automatic \
rule is drawn from the Wolfram Physics Project registry of rules (this needs \
the registry resource); the seed then records the Registry code, its metadata \
and the registry version.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->106077077,ExpressionUUID->"7e106843-8c50-9641-9b65-e48a23ddde55"],

Cell["\<\
The seed association has the keys \"OriginalRule\", \"OriginalInitialState\", \
\"CanonicalRule\", \"CanonicalInitialState\", \"Source\", \"RegistryCode\", \
\"RegistryMetadata\" and \"RegistryVersion\".\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->484684550,ExpressionUUID->"e421680d-2318-a042-aa5f-1670cb9c21bf"]
}, Open  ]],

